          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong> Linen Fabric</strong><br/>Crafted from performance blend with 460gsm weight, our linen fabric is a mix of durability and natural beauty. With its earthy organic colours, this thick yet breathable fabric offers timeless appeal. It’s also machine washable, making it practical for everyday use while maintaining a luxurious feel.<br/><br/></p><p><strong>Boucle Fabric</strong><br/>This upholstery-grade acrylic-cotton blend fabric, at 600gsm, is all about texture and style. Its cosy, soft surface gives off a trendy, inviting vibe, ideal for adding a modern yet comfortable touch to your home.</p>",
