        "title": "<p>The Koozi Side Table Crate</p>",
        "heading_highlight_type": "circle",
        "highlight_color": "#d43747",
        "highlight_text_color": "#000000",
        "description": "<p>Our Koozi Side Table Crate is designed to seamlessly blend style and functionality, offering a chic, pet-friendly solution that complements any home. With a beautiful marble-look top and a wood-inspired finish, it provides the perfect balance of elegance and durability for both you and your dog.</p>",
