    "section_accordions_6dTVbD": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "text_k3q8UK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Elm wood structure",
            "text": "<p>We understand the charm of natural elm wood with its warm texture and timeless appeal. But for a side table that doubles as a dog den, natural wood can be prone to wear, scratches, and warping in high-traffic, pet-friendly homes.</p><p>That’s why we’ve chosen to build our side table crate using <strong>plywood with a eucalyptus core and a melamine surface</strong> that replicates the rich texture and colour of natural elm wood. This combination delivers both durability and a sleek, natural aesthetic, ensuring your home looks sophisticated while being pet-friendly.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_Qp9PrH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the advantages of engineered wood?",
            "text": "<p>By using plywood with a melamine finish in an elm wood texture, we’ve created the Koozi Side Table Crate that’s both practical and elegant - perfect for those who appreciate the look and texture of natural wood, but with the durability and low-maintenance benefits of modern materials.</p><p>Here’s why this choice is ideal for your home:</p><ul><li><strong> Elm Wood Grain Texture</strong>: Our melamine finish closely mimics the natural grain of elm wood, offering a refined, organic look that complements your home’s décor. You get the warmth and beauty of wood without the vulnerability of real elm.</li><li><strong>Strong Engineered Materials</strong>: The engineered plywood core provides strength and durability, with resistance to warping. This ensures a robust structure to ensure your Koozi Side Table Crate stands up to daily use by both pets and people.</li><li><strong>Scratch & Wear Resistant</strong>: The melamine surface offers protection against scratches.</li><li><strong>Moisture Resistant</strong>: Unlike natural wood, which can absorb moisture and warp over time, the engineered wood combined with melamine prevents water damage. This is especially useful in homes with pets prone to dribbles or accidents.</li><li><strong>Stain and Heat Resistant</strong>: The material is more resistant to stains and heat damage from cups or pet-related messes. This means less worry and easy clean-up, all while keeping the look of elegant elm wood.</li><li><strong>Eco-Friendly & Sustainable</strong>: MDF plywood is a fast-growing, renewable resource, making it an eco-friendly choice for furniture construction.</li><li><strong>Easy to Clean & Maintain</strong>: Unlike solid wood that requires careful maintenance, our elm plywood is designed for easy care. A simple wipe-down is all it takes to keep the surface looking fresh, making it perfect for busy pet homes.</li></ul><p></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_RMwfpX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The Marble Top",
            "text": "<p>We know that natural marble is a beautiful material with incredible qualities - timeless, luxurious, and a true design statement. However, for a side table that doubles as a dog crate, it simply isn’t a practical safe choice. Marble can be heavy, prone to staining, and sensitive to wear, making it less suited for the everyday demands of a home with pets.</p><p>However, we didn’t want to compromise on style. That’s why we sought to replicate the classic appeal of white Carrara marble using a more practical solution that is waterproof, lighter in weight and easier to maintain. This way, pet parents can still enjoy the luxurious look of marble.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_BQM7PX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the advantages?",
            "text": "<ul><li><strong>Replicating the Look of Marble</strong>: The melamine surface captures the timeless elegance of Carrara marble, allowing you to enjoy its classic aesthetic without the fragility of natural stone. It seamlessly blends style and practicality in your home.</li><li><strong>Durable & Scratch Resistant</strong>: Unlike real marble, which can easily scratch, the melamine coating provides a durable, scratch-resistant surface. Whether it’s the occasional scuff from pet paws or daily wear, your side table will stay looking sleek and polished.</li><li><strong>Stain Resistance</strong>: Natural marble is porous, but our melamine-coated MDF resists stains, so you don’t have to worry about spills or pet-related messes causing damage or discoloration.</li><li><strong>Moisture & Heat Protection</strong>: Melamine surfaces protect against moisture and heat, essential for a table that sees everyday use. The MDF core won’t warp or degrade, and the surface stays strong even in humid conditions or with hot items placed on it.</li><li><strong>Easy Maintenance</strong>: Real marble can require special care, but our melamine-coated MDF is easy to clean with a simple wipe. It’s designed for a pet-friendly home, offering effortless maintenance without sacrificing style.</li><li><strong>Eco-Friendly & Sustainable</strong>: Using MDF made from recycled wood fibers is an environmentally conscious choice. Combined with a durable melamine coating, it offers a long-lasting alternative to solid wood or marble, while reducing environmental impact.<br/></li></ul><p><br/>With this approach, we’ve combined the best of both worlds—delivering a beautifully designed piece that’s functional for dog parents and stylish for any home.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
